    "title": "Former Lancaster High School standout Immanuel Bush's collegiate team to play for the NCAA Division I FBS Football Championship starting Friday, Dec. 5 - NC South Carolina Times",
    "text": "Former Lancaster High School standout and current James Madison Dukes player, Immanuel Bush will compete in the NCAA Division I FBS Football Championship.\nThey begin the tournament as a number 12 seed against the Troy Trojans.\nThe first game is on Friday, Dec. 5 at 6 p.m.\nImmanuel Bush — Senior — 6′1″ — 348 — Hometown: Lancaster",
